<mxCell id="c1067" value="&lt;b&gt;PLACEMENT&lt;/b&gt; (TL = board top-left corner, mm)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#212121;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215.00" y="90.00" width="545.00" height="20.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c1068" value="&lt;table style='border-collapse:collapse;font-size:10px;width:100%' border='1' cellpadding='4'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style='text-align:left'&gt;Ref&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='text-align:left'&gt;Part&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='text-align:left'&gt;Body W×D×H&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='text-align:left'&gt;Pins / anchor holes&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;J1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;2P screw terminal 5.08 (12V in)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;10.2 × 7.5 × ≈10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;D31 +, F31 −&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;J2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;2P screw terminal 5.08&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;10.2 × 7.5 × ≈10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;K31 +sw, M31 − (on GND rail)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;U1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;LM2596 buck module&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;43 × 21 × ≈14&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;body 15 / 10 from TL, pads on wire legs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;K1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Songle SRD-12VDC-SL-C&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;15.5 × 19 × 15.3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;body 60 / 10.5 from TL, pins off-grid&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Q1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;C1815 TO-92&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;4.6 × 3.7 × 4.6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;I1 E · I2 C · I3 B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;D1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;1N4007 DO-41&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Ø2.7 × 5.2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;C3 K (on rail) – G3 A&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;R1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;1kΩ 1/4 W, standing over GND rail&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Ø2.5 × 6.3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;J3 – N3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;A1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Nano + 2× 1×15 female hdr&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;43.2 × 18.5 × ≈22&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;O1–O15, U1–U15&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;J4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;1×4 male header 2.54&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;10.2 × 2.5 × 8.5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Q18 GND … Q21 VCC&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;C1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;1000µF ≥10V radial&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Ø10 × 16–20&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;U26 −, W26 +&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;R2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;330Ω 1/4 W&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;Ø2.5 × 6.3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;R25 – R29&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;J3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;3P screw terminal 5.08&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;15.2 × 7.5 × ≈10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='text-align:left'&gt;P31 GND, R31 DIN, T31 5V&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215.00" y="112.00" width="545.00" height="420.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c1069" value="&lt;b&gt;RAILS&lt;/b&gt; (bare tinned wire on the underside, soldered at every hole it crosses)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#C62828'&gt;&lt;b&gt;+12V&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; row C, cols 3–31 · &lt;b&gt;GND&lt;/b&gt; row M, cols 1–31 · &lt;font color='#E65100'&gt;&lt;b&gt;+5V&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; row Y, cols 1–31.&lt;br&gt;12V parts sit between +12V and GND, 5V parts between GND and +5V: every power link is a short stub, none crosses a rail.&lt;br&gt;Strip current: J1 + → +12V rail → K1 COM/NO → J2 → GND rail → J1 −. Both terminals and K1 sit at the right end, so the heavy path is short: use ≥0.8 mm (AWG 20) wire for the +12V rail cols 25–31, the NO→J2 wire and the GND rail cols 30–31.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;POWER INPUT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The DC jack is panel-mounted on the enclosure; its two wires go into J1 (top right). Put F1 (inline fuse holder, ≈ strip current + 1 A) on the + wire. J2 (main strip) sits right under J1.&lt;br&gt;U1 OUT+ comes down as a short insulated wire past the module's right end into N23, then runs to the +5V rail on col 23: the only power wire that crosses the GND rail, on the top side.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MEASURE BEFORE SOLDERING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Board: 31 × 26 holes, grid assumed centred (6.90 / 3.25 from the edges). Mounting-hole positions unknown.&lt;br&gt;2. U1: drawn 43 × 21. Up to 45 mm long still clears D1 and K1; IN/OUT and +/− pad order follow the module silkscreen.&lt;br&gt;3. K1 pins (&lt;font color='#E65100'&gt;orange&lt;/font&gt;) are approximate and off-grid: mark them from the real relay. *NO/NC: check with a multimeter (COM–NC = 0Ω at rest); NO goes to J2.&lt;br&gt;4. A1 labels assume the common Nano layout (USB → left, D12…TX1 on the top row). Check the silkscreen.&lt;br&gt;5. Heights: Nano ≈22 on headers, C1 up to 20, K1 15.3, U1 ≈14." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;spacing=10;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;fillColor=#FAFAFA;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1215.00" y="545.00" width="545.00" height="425.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c1070" value="&lt;b&gt;LEGEND&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Underside:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color='#C62828'&gt;━ +12V&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;━ GND&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#E65100'&gt;━ +5V&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#6A1B9A'&gt;━ coil low side&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#2E7D32'&gt;━ solder bridge&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;Top side (insulated):&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color='#7F0000'&gt;┅ switched +12V (thick)&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#E65100'&gt;┅ U1 OUT+&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#1565C0'&gt;┅ signal&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;● on-grid lead &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#E65100'&gt;○ off-grid pin (approx.)&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp; ■ header/terminal pin &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#1565C0'&gt;↔ dimension (mm)&lt;/font&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;font color='#9E9E9E'&gt;◌ screw keep-out (assumed)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;spacing=10;strokeColor=#BDBDBD;fillColor=#FAFAFA;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.00" y="1240.00" width="1100.00" height="60.00" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
